  "body": "This PR contains the following updates:\n\n| Package | Type | Update | Change | References |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| webdriverio | devDependencies | patch | [`5.7.1` -> `5.7.2`](https://diff.intrinsic.com/webdriverio/5.7.1/5.7.2) | [homepage](https://webdriver.io), [source](https://togithub.com/webdriverio/webdriverio) |\n\n---\n\n### Release Notes\n\n<details>\n<summary>webdriverio/webdriverio</summary>\n\n### [`v5.7.2`](https://togithub.com/webdriverio/webdriverio/blob/master/CHANGELOG.md#&#8203;572-2019-03-10)\n\n[Compare Source](https://togithub.com/webdriverio/webdriverio/compare/v5.7.1...v5.7.2)\n\n##### :bug: Bug Fix\n\n-   `webdriverio`\n    -   [#&#8203;3701](https://togithub.com/webdriverio/webdriverio/pull/3701) webdriverio: fix isDisplayed ([@&#8203;mgrybyk](https://togithub.com/mgrybyk))\n    -   [#&#8203;3697](https://togithub.com/webdriverio/webdriverio/pull/3697) webdriverio: fix options in multiremote ([@&#8203;mgrybyk](https://togithub.com/mgrybyk))\n-   `wdio-config`\n    -   [#&#8203;3705](https://togithub.com/webdriverio/webdriverio/pull/3705) Also clear protocol if not set ([@&#8203;christian-bromann](https://togithub.com/christian-bromann))\n\n##### :nail_care: Polish\n\n-   `wdio-spec-reporter`\n    -   [#&#8203;3702](https://togithub.com/webdriverio/webdriverio/pull/3702) Issue 3416: Allow the spec reporter to expose multiple errors if present ([@&#8203;nicholasbailey](https://togithub.com/nicholasbailey))\n-   `wdio-applitools-service`\n    -   [#&#8203;3696](https://togithub.com/webdriverio/webdriverio/pull/3696) [FEATURE] Add ability to set serverUrl ([@&#8203;kevinmcdonnell](https://togithub.com/kevinmcdonnell))\n-   `wdio-cli`, `wdio-config`, `wdio-reporter`\n    -   [#&#8203;3625](https://togithub.com/webdriverio/webdriverio/pull/3625) Create a `outputDir` logs folder if doesn't exist ([@&#8203;nami-varthakavi](https://togithub.com/nami-varthakavi))\n-   `wdio-browserstack-service`\n    -   [#&#8203;3691](https://togithub.com/webdriverio/webdriverio/pull/3691)  browserstack-service: Closes [#&#8203;3648](https://togithub.com/webdriverio/webdriverio/issues/3648) modifying name and reason ([@&#8203;OriTheMan](https://togithub.com/OriTheMan))\n\n##### :memo: Documentation\n\n-   [#&#8203;3695](https://togithub.com/webdriverio/webdriverio/pull/3695) Corrected config field for filtering cucumber scenarios by tag ([@&#8203;tompahoward](https://togithub.com/tompahoward))\n\n##### :house: Internal\n\n-   `webdriverio`\n    -   [#&#8203;3710](https://togithub.com/webdriverio/webdriverio/pull/3710) webdriverio: fix linter errors (fix failing build) ([@&#8203;mgrybyk](https://togithub.com/mgrybyk))\n-   `wdio-allure-reporter`, `wdio-applitools-service`, `wdio-browserstack-service`, `wdio-cli`, `wdio-config`, `wdio-devtools-service`, `wdio-firefox-profile-service`, `wdio-jasmine-framework`, `wdio-junit-reporter`, `wdio-local-runner`, `wdio-mocha-framework`, `wdio-reporter`, `wdio-runner`, `wdio-sauce-service`, `wdio-selenium-standalone-service`, `wdio-spec-reporter`, `wdio-webdriver-mock-service`, `webdriver`, `webdriverio`\n    -   [#&#8203;3706](https://togithub.com/webdriverio/webdriverio/pull/3706) Enforce more eslint rules ([@&#8203;christian-bromann](https://togithub.com/christian-bromann))\n\n##### Committers: 7\n\n-   Christian Bromann ([@&#8203;christian-bromann](https://togithub.com/christian-bromann))\n-   Kevin McDonnell ([@&#8203;kevinmcdonnell](https://togithub.com/kevinmcdonnell))\n-   Mykola Grybyk ([@&#8203;mgrybyk](https://togithub.com/mgrybyk))\n-   Nami Varthakavi ([@&#8203;nami-varthakavi](https://togithub.com/nami-varthakavi))\n-   Nicholas Bailey ([@&#8203;nicholasbailey](https://togithub.com/nicholasbailey))\n-   Ori Efrati ([@&#8203;OriTheMan](https://togithub.com/OriTheMan))\n-   Tom Howard ([@&#8203;tompahoward](https://togithub.com/tompahoward))\n\n</details>\n\n---\n\n### Renovate configuration\n\n:date: **Schedule**: \"every weekend\" in timezone Europe/Paris.\n\n:vertical_traffic_light: **Automerge**: Enabled.\n\n:recycle: **Rebasing**: Whenever PR is stale, or if you modify the PR title to begin with \"`rebase!`\".\n\n:no_bell: **Ignore**: Close this PR and you won't be reminded about this update again.\n\n---\n\n - [ ] <!-- renovate-rebase -->If you want to rebase/retry this PR, check this box\n\n---\n\nThis PR has been generated by [Renovate Bot](https://togithub.com/marketplace/renovate). View repository job log [here](https://renovatebot.com/dashboard#algolia/instantsearch.js).",
